From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:52:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Keep threaded facet WebSockets across idle retirement

Park root and facet transports in one handoff. Carry the facet's startup options, use its own WebSocket manager on reopen, and forward the native upgrade through local facet fetches.

